    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rainy Day&quot; is a block-puzzle game that blends rainy-day ambiance aesthetics. Players move unique blocks to solve intricate puzzles accompanied by the gentle patter of rainfall, with no time limits or penalties. Serene Zen-inspired mechanisms harmonize with white noise of dripping water, creating a meditative experience perfect for gloomy afternoons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646560/extras/8837d35ae36f1d055726e120b73fe9e6.avif?t=1745542107\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Important Note: <strong><i><u>The arrows</u></i></strong> on top of the block <strong><i><u>indicate the directions</u></i></strong> in which the block can move under the current state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646560/extras/45b21e4f6b634736f8f6c27b9d01c091.avif?t=1745542107\" data-has-big width=800 height=652 /></span></p>",
